      "text": "Come unto me … heavy laden, and I will give you rest, Matt. 11:28 (Rev. 14:13). rested the sabbath day according to the commandment, Luke 23:56. power of Christ may rest upon me, 2 Cor. 12:9. you who are troubled rest with us, 2 Thes. 1:7. promise being left us of entering into his rest, Heb. 4:1. we which have believed do enter into rest, Heb. 4:3. Let us labour therefore to enter into that rest, Heb. 4:11. spirit of glory and of God resteth upon you, 1 Pet. 4:14. that they should rest yet for a little season, Rev. 6:11.",
