    {
      "text": "we labored … that they might enter into his rest, Jacob 1:7. place of my rest … with my Redeemer, Enos 1:27. blessing of the Lord hath rested upon us, Alma 10:11. whosoever repenteth … shall enter into my rest, Alma 12:34. teach his commandments … that they also might enter into his rest, Alma 13:6. lifted up … and enter into his rest, Alma 13:29. paradise, a state of rest, Alma 40:12. nothing entereth into his rest save it be those who have washed their garments, 3 Ne. 27:19. come unto me in my kingdom; and with me ye shall find rest, 3 Ne. 28:3. pass away, even like unto the rest of the earth, Ether 10:17. enter into the rest of the Lord, Moro. 7:3. rest our souls in the kingdom of God, Moro. 9:6. soon go to rest in the paradise of God, Moro. 10:34.",
